00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:10.570
Or if we ever wanted to tag
along and play with them,

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.400
it was well, if you can't keep up,

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:13.630
then you can't play with us.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:16.459
So that was just our normal growing up.

00:20:16.459 --> 00:20:17.292
- Yeah.

