because there was that
little interest in the NBA

00:26:51.200 --> 00:26:53.891
and then David Stern with,

00:26:53.891 --> 00:26:56.650
obviously you need Larry
Bird and Magic Johnson

00:26:56.650 --> 00:26:59.990
