You know, the Iceman, George
Gervin, and Connie Hawkins

00:27:03.500 --> 00:27:06.120
and Dr. J were pretty, and Pistol Pete,

00:27:06.120 --> 00:27:07.320
were pretty remarkable.

00:27:07.320 --> 00:27:09.830
They weren't in a framework
that understood how to build,

00:27:09.830 --> 00:27:11.530
it's what's happening to baseball.

00:27:13.670 --> 00:27:17.023
America is becoming more
Hispanic, LATAM, every day.

00:27:18.310 --> 00:27:20.740
The greatest athletes in American sport,

00:27:20.740 --> 00:27:24.320
that are Hispanic, are
in Major League Baseball.

