00:27:29.230 --> 00:27:31.040
So I'm always fascinated,

00:27:31.040 --> 00:27:36.040
I genuinely believe America
is a fame star culture.

00:27:37.520 --> 00:27:39.260
And when you have Mike Tyson,

00:27:39.260 --> 00:27:40.429
and America cares, boxing's huge

00:27:40.429 --> 00:27:43.188
and when you don't, they don't.

00:27:43.188 --> 00:27:46.821
And so I genuinely believe,

00:27:46.821 --> 00:27:50.300
that women's athletics across the board

00:27:50.300 --> 00:27:52.460
are really fascinating at
the professional level,

00:27:52.460 --> 00:27:56.000
because I think of it as
star power for the WNBA,

00:27:56.000 --> 00:27:57.090
this women's soccer league,

00:27:57.090 --> 00:27:59.240
whatever you're about to tell
me about the hockey league,

00:27:59.240 --> 00:28:02.250
