00:28:12.260 --> 00:28:13.093
- Right?

00:28:13.093 --> 00:28:15.640
That's a soap opera and it's a framework,

00:28:15.640 --> 00:28:18.440
and so when you have Hulk
Hogan and Macho Man and Andre,

00:28:18.440 --> 00:28:20.710
you have an era and then
you go cold for a while,

00:28:20.710 --> 00:28:22.490
and then when you're lucky
enough to get the charisma

